  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "海綿方褲"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>殷&nbsp; &nbsp; 雷</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">啥人蹛tī深海ê大王梨中？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">漢草外方內圓　性地外圓內方</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">若準sì-kè冒險是你ê願望</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā甲板挵--lueh叫大魚出來講</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">——筆者翻譯、改寫bàng-gà《海綿方褲》主題曲</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Iáu ē記得囡仔時</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">食飯上愛配《海綿方褲》</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐工中晝12點</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">電視機頭前膨椅坐--leh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">目睭peh hōo金金金　看海綿方褲</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">來蟳堡王做蟳堡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">去海thē田掠海thē</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">橫直　就是sì-kè tshia̍k-tshia̍k-tiô</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā朋友仙智tàu-sann-kāng</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kah兄弟派星答喙鼓</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">單純ê日子古意ê人　只是</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">想東想西想lóng無</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蹛tī隔壁hit箍Thak-khooh兄</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">哪ē規年thàng天結屎面？</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大漢了後現此時</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">食飯tio̍h-ài配指定閱讀</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐工半暝12點</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">窗仔門邊--a柴椅坐--leh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">電火開kah光光光　讀指定閱讀</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">來評論欄留評論</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">去作業區交作業</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">忝--ah　就ē sì-kè luā-luā趖</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā貓仔『咪咪』ma-sà-tsì</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kah室友阿睿拍lā涼</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">操勞ê日子厭siān ê人　總--是</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">想東想西想lóng無</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">活tī íng過hit个少年兄</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">哪thang一日到暗好笑神？</span></p></blockquote><p><br /></p><p>Bàng-gà相關名詞對照表</p><p>台文<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>原文<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>華文</p><p>海綿方褲<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>SpongeBob SquarePants<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>海綿寶寶</p><p>蟳堡王<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>Krusty Krab<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>蟹堡王</p><p>蟳堡<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>Krabby Patty<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>美味蟹堡</p><p>海thē田<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>Jellyfish Fields<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>水母田</p><p>仙智<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>Sandy<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>珊迪</p><p>派星<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>Patrick<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>派大星</p><p>Thak-khooh兄<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>Squidward<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>章魚哥</p><p><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5qxCbUX3Z4naHup2lz-kwqfkfOHVBofDMX3dojRRgiS0XunbzIJxVoOjtWRioHNO-eO4oyangML3E1nMJcE1nrEzqSmJeIz4noyxJEoIFJGdMNM0D5WMN3H8mz5T6wfrn5U_KyAiJlygOx7L7NXYgQhxLX_OtmoQEbf6Sl6vy6Ey569dcjS6cPxnfAPxt/s320/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1374%E6%9C%9F_6.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"320\" data-original-width=\"229\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5qxCbUX3Z4naHup2lz-kwqfkfOHVBofDMX3dojRRgiS0XunbzIJxVoOjtWRioHNO-eO4oyangML3E1nMJcE1nrEzqSmJeIz4noyxJEoIFJGdMNM0D5WMN3H8mz5T6wfrn5U_KyAiJlygOx7L7NXYgQhxLX_OtmoQEbf6Sl6vy6Ey569dcjS6cPxnfAPxt/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%8